{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/a/d8acaaa2351e5743f4a800262cd1e568413f655d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1001} 7^{1002} 13^{1003}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5fb53a6393ed881fdcc87a3c1581922e3706dc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11ce47412f33e1af05bd0fd1feaca002225ded1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^0$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1f14aead0e3f8b4fd698ef1a2971a6edaf8d276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4ce0583e43880c5a6892f664bd95f9a34b53a5f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b384403f238e2e84b8abb78e4f064f3bb8d0e345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819068968ed60608a91d0c3921d6296964660e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/1/bb1dde9caa14777516b81344cdb7080e0b7791bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4aaecd00c115e0a1f5d807ac00b10f428d07993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/a/08aeb8ff32d1c5e0e2ba25d51cff481dbac53771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2259c263bde7b68aadfeca3df73046a41c953212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1f14aead0e3f8b4fd698ef1a2971a6edaf8d276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />, and so on. This turns out to be a cycle repeating every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/b/cbbcfbbd5852df3f40b8c4f52a9ccc129a9acef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1001}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b384403f238e2e84b8abb78e4f064f3bb8d0e345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has a similar cycle, going <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf4c1bb5371b201b38a623852e702c5269eddfb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 7, 9, 3, 1, ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" /> Hence we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/9/cc9c4e0dfe7f8285089da4759d9508157127c815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{1002}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/1/bb1dde9caa14777516b81344cdb7080e0b7791bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" />. Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed8ab79bd63627c32c697547409ec80e4269ed2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13^{1003}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/1/40198467a2ccb9bb1c9def3f9d5a42bbd55988ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1003} \\equiv 7 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"19\" />. Thus the required units digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc147912ed07b500d2cc49d4ef799aa9caec1ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 9\\cdot 7 \\equiv 9 \\ \\text{(mod 10)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e51224f17ec28d20390a6d68e5561436015394c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By Euler's Totient Theorem, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4ad2f5712159187cd151f56a09b08f9a98cde8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a, 10) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe9d4e289ff5fca2a665085cfe7a93a00b18c2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\phi(10)} \\equiv a^4 \\equiv 1\\ (\\mathrm{mod}\\ 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a36665a51d9b1f44f7d75bf09579b5a7077ed2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1001} \\cdot 7^{1002} \\cdot 13^{1003} \\equiv 3^{1001} \\cdot 7^{1002} \\cdot 3^{1003} \\equiv 3^{2004} \\cdot 7^{1002} \\equiv 3^0 \\cdot 7^2 \\equiv 1 \\cdot 9 \\equiv \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9}\\ (\\mathrm{mod}\\ 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"698\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>